From 95c3b4429f13b94d2a2641e261259d4e9366fba3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Catherine Grabar <catherine.grabar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:43:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] M2 steps 3-4: extract SimWorld and route all actors
 through apply_action

- systems/sim/sim_world.gd: grid truth (tiles/objects, generation, growth,
  walkability) extracted from farm.gd into a RefCounted sim class with no
  Node/autoload/rendering dependencies (five-layer shape, ARCHITECTURE.md)
- apply_action() is now the single mutation gateway (S-3): player tile
  verbs, sell/refill/collect, shop buy_seed, sleep (day advance + weather +
  shipping), crow eat_crop, chicken lay_egg all flow through it with the
  pre-M2 guards preserved exactly
- farm.gd becomes renderer + thin facade (same public API, tests unchanged)
- player/crow/chicken/menus/main updated to submit Actions and keep only
  presentation (sfx, particles, animation) on their side

Suites: unit 141/141, integration 20/20.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
